# This directory expects two audio files:
#   intro.mp3  — intro/gate scene music ("The Great Beyond")
#   pulse.mp3  — rhythm game music, loops continuously ("Translucent Supernova")
#
# The MP3 files are excluded from git via .gitignore.
# Copy them here manually or run:
#   cp "The Great Beyond.mp3" public/audio/intro.mp3
#   cp "Translucent Supernova (Modify).mp3" public/audio/pulse.mp3
